@startmindmap
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
caption Resource bounds that keep libcpg's work finite on large or untrusted inputs

*[#F1F3F5] Resource bounds
**[#FFE3E3] Construction
***[#F1F3F5]:max_file_size = 10 MB default
build() rejects larger source before parsing.
build_from_tree (Mode B) skips it —
the caller already owns a bounded tree.;
**[#FFE3E3] Call resolution
***[#F1F3F5]:max_scope_depth = 128
bounds parent and callee-subtree depth
and visited sets cut malformed cycles.;
***[#F1F3F5]:max_candidates_per_name = 64
bounds retained candidate identifiers
without changing the full ambiguity count.;
***[#F1F3F5]:max_calls = 100,000
processes a deterministic NodeId prefix
and leaves later calls untouched.;
**[#FFE3E3] VF2 matching
***[#F1F3F5]:max_matches cap (0 = unlimited default)
short-circuits the state-space search
once the match limit is reached.;
***[#F1F3F5]:strict_kinds / strict_edges
tighten the feasibility test, pruning
infeasible branches earlier.;
**[#FFE3E3] DFG
***[#F1F3F5]:structural AST sweep
one ordinary pass, exactly two loop-body passes,
and a path set that cuts malformed cycles.;
**[#FFE3E3] Monotone solver
***[#F1F3F5]:max_visits_per_block = 256 default
returns IterationLimitExceeded when a block
would be extracted beyond the hard cap.;
***[#F1F3F5]:widen_after + narrow_passes
widening is confined to LoopForest headers,
narrowing runs exactly the bounded pass count.;
**[#FFE3E3] Condensation analytics
***[#F1F3F5]:max_components = 1,000,000 hard ceiling
total metrics return a capped incomplete report and
direct Coffman-Graham returns BudgetExceeded.;
***[#F1F3F5]:public decomposition validation
rejects inconsistent membership, invalid edges,
self-loops, cycles, and zero layering width.;
**[#FFE3E3] DSM visibility
***[#F1F3F5]:MAX_DSM_NODES = 50,000
rejects before repeated breadth-first search,
returns a capped incomplete result with no partial vectors.;
***[#F1F3F5]:public projection + provenance validation
rejects malformed forward/reverse CSR, mismatched nodes,
vector lengths, and incomplete source analyses.;
**[#FFE3E3] WL refinement
***[#F1F3F5]:MAX_WL_ITERATIONS = 16
clamps every requested round count before work,
including a request of the machine maximum.;
***[#F1F3F5]:shared public projection validation
rejects malformed node, CSR, weight, or reverse state
before indexed traversal and returns empty output.;
**[#FFE3E3] Centrality
***[#F1F3F5]:MAX_CENTRALITY_ITERATIONS = 10,000
clamps PageRank, eigenvector, Katz, and HITS;
***[#F1F3F5]:explicit work budgets
preflight Brandes, distance, edge-betweenness,
and Burt neighborhood operations before traversal.;
***[#F1F3F5]:projection + numeric validation
rejects malformed CSR, non-finite options,
    and unsafe Katz attenuation without partial rankings.;
**[#FFE3E3] Community detection
***[#F1F3F5]:MAX_LOUVAIN_PASSES = 50
clamps dense local-moving sweeps independently
at every aggregation level.;
***[#F1F3F5]:MAX_LOUVAIN_LEVELS = 10
clamps graph contractions and defines zero levels
as a canonical no-work singleton result.;
***[#F1F3F5]:projection + numeric validation
rejects malformed CSR, invalid resolution, negative or
non-finite weights, and overflowing reciprocal sums.;
**[#FFE3E3] Slicing
***[#F1F3F5]:max_nodes on backward_slice / forward_slice
bounds the PDG reverse/forward BFS —
returns as soon as the slice reaches the cap.;
@endmindmap
